Goes into the virt-install line
--extra-args 'console=ttyS0 inst.ks=http://[server-ip-address]:8000/kickstart.ks'

Also, edit the setup_VM2.sh to set the hostname and also edit the anaconda kickstart file to set the hostname.

Then copy the kickstart into the kickstart folder and start a webserver there.
> python3 -m http.server 8000
